 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.webm?t=1756587494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.mp4?t=1756587494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machine was given one objective; make as much jam as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jam's Adjustable Mirrors, help the friendly Jam-bot manipulate rays of sunlight to power an elaborate (and questionably legal) jam-making operation! Each level will introduce a unique board of obstacles, testing your logic and skill in strategically placing and rotating many kinds of mirrors, bouncing light beams across levels and even through space and time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With workshop support and an included level editor, design and share your challenging levels with others! You're not alone, and the abductions persist. After all, the server's hum and key clicks suggest that many minds are working to satisfy the machine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of light manipulation and keep that machine appeased, lest it dooms you to a life of eternal jamming...<br><br>You mustn't let anything stop you from growing those sweet, juicy jam plants. <br>Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.poster.avif?t=1756587494\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c30a36aa1cee6f800c5.webm?t=1756587494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890550/extras/5051308139cf1c